    {
      "source": "Construct a new <code>LookupOverride</code>.",
      "translation": "构建一个新的<code>LookupOverride</code>。",
      "count": 4
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>beanName</code> - the name of the bean in the current <code>BeanFactory</code> that the\noverridden method should return (may be <code>null</code> for type-based bean retrieval)",
      "translation": "`beanName` - 当前 `BeanFactory` 中应被重写方法返回的 Bean 名称（对于基于类型的 Bean 检索，可能为 `null`）",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "In case of a provided <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/reflect/Method.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang.reflect\"><code>Method</code></a>, only straight matches will\nbe considered, usually demarcated by the <code>@Lookup</code> annotation.",
      "translation": "如果提供了 `<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/reflect/Method.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang.reflect\"><code>Method</code></a>`，则仅考虑直接匹配项，通常由 `<code>@Lookup</code>` 注解标记。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Methods eligible for lookup override may declare arguments in which case the\ngiven arguments are passed to the bean retrieval operation.",
      "translation": "可用于查找覆盖的方法可以声明参数，在这种情况下，给定的参数将传递给 Bean 检索操作。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "For backwards compatibility reasons, in a scenario with overloaded\nnon-abstract methods of the given name, only the no-arg variant of a\nmethod will be turned into a container-driven lookup method.",
      "translation": "出于向后兼容性的考虑，在给定名称存在重载的非抽象方法的情况下，只有无参的方法变体才会被转换为容器驱动的查找方法。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Return the name of the bean that should be returned by this <code>LookupOverride</code>.",
      "translation": "返回此<code>LookupOverride</code>应返回的 Bean 名称。",
      "count": 2
    },
